msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就像在谴责我的行为……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86432f280da6d11f9d8747e36c07d629331bfb14621dec1d8d38ce70cce3ad13
#. default-sha256: 3b3d1af858fbf8cc5696bbba74be9c1cc0ec01d171f126656ba3c8895ecfa7ec
