msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但我并没有停下脚步——⟪k:1⟫而是径直前往瞭望塔。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 808f9c8d174660ae74cda574681dcc5b5cdf840382b8376a884d9af8257cf2ce
