msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the day someone would truly set me free."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫等待能够真正解放我的人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 036c00f97c46763fceee1f1b02093ad72971c8dd0f8995420016b28050606e7b
