#: scenario7:scenario7_3905A0DF_5399_40E6_89EA_481CCE30AF81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 701a2939edc271949d1c4774850e88c01e2621158385fb00c8874db14e3e991c
