msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我还以为……魔女只是迷信……⟪k:1⟫只是编出来的……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AD899BFA_FFBD_4B11_9952_AADF7BCE7E87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbdaea77bcc3817270f099333318758c2a4f40a789669e97f511d7c287973734
#. default-sha256: 304c369a3b9603649a3ef09290ecced1965450ad69cdcbcb776077dd3ae2dcea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AD899BFA_FFBD_4B11_9952_AADF7BCE7E87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you don’t believe me, I would be happy to show you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let’s see..."
